{"title":"2001 AMC 10 Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Daily_Dose_of_Math\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_DDM\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by DDM</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_10_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> more than the product of its <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Reciprocal\" title=\"Reciprocal\">reciprocal</a> and its additive <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Inverse\" title=\"Inverse\">inverse</a>. In which <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Interval\" title=\"Interval\">interval</a> does the number lie?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/1/661a80ae6d15f5c1d473995e57bcc6ba43d35aa1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }\\ -4\\le x\\le -2\\qquad\\textbf{(B) }\\ -2 &lt; x\\le 0\\qquad\\textbf{(C) }0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"404\" height=\"17\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/4/43419a3755842990aa1ad232c7626fbaddbfaa8d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$&lt; x \\le 2 \\qquad \\textbf{(D) }\\ 2 &lt; x\\le 4\\qquad\\textbf{(E) }\\ 4 &lt; x\\le 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"363\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_10_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can write our <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Equation\" title=\"Equation\">equation</a> as \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/0/660bb79bb2d973d95d7f5e8337f32cc93dbeaa82.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x= \\left(\\frac{1}{x} \\right) \\cdot (-x) +2 = -1+2 = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"269\" height=\"43\" />.\nTherefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/4/ad481ae6cd4fd8a68c538c67647555d281613b6f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C) }0 &lt; x\\le 2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"125\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Daily_Dose_of_Math\">Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_10_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/6wBIYhmCfo8?si=tRO5zDw7syrXCPsS\">https://youtu.be/6wBIYhmCfo8?si=tRO5zDw7syrXCPsS</a>\n</p><p>~Thesmartgreekmathdude\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_DDM\">Video Solution by DDM</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_10_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by DDM\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/n25Ncoj3CMg\">https://youtu.be/n25Ncoj3CMg</a>\n</p><p>~piggydude\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_10_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_10\" title=\"2001 AMC 10\">2001 AMC 10</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_10_Problems\" title=\"2001 AMC 10 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_10_Answer_Key\" title=\"2001 AMC 10 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" alig